.TH SDDM-AUTHELIA-PASSKEY-ADMIN 8 "2026-09-12" "sddm-authelia-passkey" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
sddm-authelia-passkey-admin \- read-only admin CLI for sddm-authelia-passkey
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sddm-authelia-passkey-admin
.RI { status | health | test-config | list-users | audit-log | mode-status | migrate-status | branding-status }
.br
.B sddm-authelia-passkey-admin apply-mode
.RI { native | compatibility | backend-only }
.br
.B sddm-authelia-passkey-admin migrate-preflight
.RI { native | compatibility | backend-only }
.br
.B sddm-authelia-passkey-admin migrate
.RI { native | compatibility | backend-only }
.br
.B sddm-authelia-passkey-admin
.RI { rollback-migration | migrate-resume }
.SH DESCRIPTION
A fixed-dispatch helper for common sddm-authelia-passkey administration.
It is not a general shell or configuration-editing interface.
Only
.BR apply-mode ", " migrate ", " rollback-migration " and " migrate-resume
change SDDM theme selection; all other subcommands are read-only.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
.B status\fR, \fBhealth
Report whether the broker, sddm, and (if enabled) kwallet-secretd are
currently up. Delegates to
.IR /usr/share/sddm-authelia-passkey/postflight.sh .
Requires root.
.TP
.B test-config
Validate
.I /etc/sddm-authelia-passkey/config.conf
and exit, without starting the broker or touching PAM/systemd.
Delegates to the broker binary's own
.B \-\-check\-config
flag. Does not require root.
.TP
.B list-users
Show which accounts are currently eligible for the passwordless path
(per
.IR account_source ,
.IR allowed_users ,
.IR minimum_uid ,
.I deny_users
and
.IR allowed_groups ),
and which accounts have a FIDO2 credential enrolled. Requires root.
.TP
.B mode-status
Report the current installation mode, effective SDDM theme, managed
selection state, target validation and preserved baseline theme.
Requires root.
.TP
.B apply-mode native|compatibility|backend-only
Explicitly select the Native Theme, compatibility theme, or restore the
previous SDDM theme selection and return to backend-only operation.
The operation is idempotent, does not restart SDDM and does not terminate
active sessions. Requires root.
.TP
.B audit-log
Show
.B SECURITY:\-tagged
broker log lines (authorization denials, identity mismatches,
successful approvals) via
.BR journalctl (1).
Requires root.
.TP
.B migrate-preflight native|compatibility|backend-only
Read-only check of a prospective mode migration: current mode, whether
the target is a no-op, whether the target theme is valid, and whether an
earlier migration was left interrupted. Never changes state. Requires root.
.TP
.B migrate native|compatibility|backend-only
Migrate to the given mode, recording the prior mode so it can be undone
with
.BR rollback-migration .
Refuses to proceed if an earlier migration is still marked interrupted;
resolve that first with
.B migrate-resume
or
.BR rollback-migration .
Idempotent, does not restart SDDM and does not terminate active sessions.
Requires root.
.TP
.B rollback-migration
Undo the most recent successful migration (single-level undo, not a
history stack), or - if an operation was left interrupted - restore the
mode that was active before that interrupted attempt. Requires root.
.TP
.B migrate-resume
Re-apply the target mode of an interrupted migration to complete it.
Fails if no migration is currently marked interrupted. Requires root.
.TP
.B migrate-status
Report the last completed migration (from/to mode, completion time) and
whether a migration is currently marked interrupted. Requires root.
.TP
.B branding-status
Check the optional
.I theme.conf.user
branding override for both the Native Theme and the compatibility
theme for unsafe ownership, symlinks, or group/world writability, and
neutralize (move aside, never delete) anything found unsafe so the
greeter always falls back to safe zero-config branding instead of
trusting it. Runs automatically on every install/upgrade; safe to
re-run at any time. Requires root.
.SH FILES
.I /etc/sddm-authelia-passkey/config.conf
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR /usr/share/doc/sddm-authelia-passkey/rollback.md ,
.IR /usr/share/doc/sddm-authelia-passkey/theme-migration.md ,
.IR /usr/share/doc/sddm-authelia-passkey/native-theme-hardening.md
